OL,7,     Ftruck drivers in Canada and
OL,8,     FAlaska. As the end of the season
OL,9,     Fnears, the rivals make a
OL,10,     Ffour-truck convoy and set out over
OL,11,     Fa closed road.
OL,12,G0230 Trucking Hell
OL,13,     FReality series. A large truck
OL,14,     Fcareers off the A1, crashes
OL,15,     Fthrough the side barrier and gets
OL,16,     Ftangled up in live electrics.
OL,17,     FMerrie deals with a lorry that has
OL,18,     Fgot stuck on the verge.
